# Start: a systems page, focus on SELECT ALL. End: the same page reopened,
# focus on SELECT ALL, with SCRAPED GAME CONTENT flipped. Up from the first
# row is BACK, then the switch (last row); B closes and saves; A on the
# transfer page's remembered row reopens the page under the new rule.
key up
wait 1
key up
wait 1
key x
wait 1
shot switch-flipped
key z
wait 2
key x
wait 7
shot systems-page-recounted
